8
00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:15.022
No pitch.

9
00:00:15.422 --> 00:00:16.511
No pressure.

10
00:00:16.711 --> 00:00:18.480
Either way, you'll know
your next step.

11
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.306
I'd love to hear from you.
